---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import '../styles/globals.css'
---

<Base
  title="Laso - Recovery, Readiness, and Health Intelligence"
  description="Laso turns Apple Health and wearable data into daily readiness, recovery, sleep, strain, stress, risk signals, and long-term trends with actionable guidance."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">

    <!-- ════════ NAV ════════ -->
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="nav-blur fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 border-b border-gray-100/60">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 h-12 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="#" class="text-[22px] font-bold tracking-tight text-apple-dark hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Laso</a>
        <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-7">
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="text-[13px] font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">How it works</a>
          <a href="#why-laso" class="text-[13px] font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">Why Laso</a>
          <a href="#features" class="text-[13px] font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">Features</a>
          <a href="#devices" class="text-[13px] font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">Devices</a>
        </div>
        <a href="#early-access" class="bg-apple-dark text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 hover:bg-black transition-colors">
          Get Early Access
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ════════ HERO ════════ -->
    <section data-section="hero" class="hero-gradient pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-44 md:pb-24 px-5 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-apple-blue/10 text-apple-blue text-sm font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-apple-blue rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
        iOS Early Access Open
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-[1.08]">
        Your wearable tells you what happened.
        <span class="gradient-text">Laso tells you what to do.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-apple-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto text-balance leading-relaxed">
        Recovery score, strain coach, sleep debt, stress monitor, illness prediction, and Vitality Age. 86 health metrics, one daily brief.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
        <form id="hero-form" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <input
            type="email"
            placeholder="your@email.com"
            required
            class="hero-email-input flex-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-5 py-3 text-[15px] text-apple-dark placeholder:text-apple-secondary/50 focus:outline-none focus:border-apple-blue focus:ring-1 focus:ring-apple-blue/30 transition-colors"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="bg-apple-dark text-white font-medium rounded-full px-7 py-3 text-[15px] hover:bg-black transition-colors active:scale-[0.97] cursor-pointer shrink-0"
          >
            Join Early Access
          </button>
        </form>
        <p class="hero-success mt-3 text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium hidden">You're in! We'll be in touch soon.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] text-apple-secondary/60">Free to join. <strong class="text-apple-dark"><span class="signup-counter">0</span> have joined</strong>. We'll notify you when it's ready.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ YOUR MORNING BRIEF ════════ -->
    <section data-section="brief" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          Open Laso. Know exactly how to train today.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Five answers in 30 seconds. Every morning, before you decide anything.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-600">84</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-dark mt-1">Recovery</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-secondary mt-0.5">Push hard today</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 text-center" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.72 9.72 0 0 1 18 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 0 0 3 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 0 0 9.002-5.998Z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">7h 42m</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-dark mt-1">Sleep</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-secondary mt-0.5">96% of target</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 text-center" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-orange-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f97316" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0 1 12 21 8.25 8.25 0 0 1 6.038 7.047 8.287 8.287 0 0 0 9 9.601a8.983 8.983 0 0 1 3.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 0 0 3 2.48Z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-orange-500">8.4</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-dark mt-1">Strain</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-secondary mt-0.5">Target: 8–12</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 text-center" style="transition-delay:180ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#eab308" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904 9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09 3.09Z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-600">Low</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-dark mt-1">Stress</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-secondary mt-0.5">Below baseline</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 text-center" style="transition-delay:240ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-green-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">Clear</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-dark mt-1">Health Risks</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-secondary mt-0.5">No warnings</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-xs text-apple-secondary/50 text-center">Sample daily brief. All values generated from your own wearable data.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ VITALITY AGE ════════ -->
    <section data-section="vitality" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="section-reveal md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-14 items-center">
          <div>
            <p class="text-apple-blue text-sm font-semibold mb-3">Vitality Age</p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark leading-snug">
              Your biological age,<br/>measured every day.
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Laso computes your Vitality Age from 9 key metrics: VO2 Max, HRV, resting heart rate,
              sleep efficiency, deep sleep, walking speed, daily steps, exercise minutes, and body composition.
              It tells you whether you're aging faster or slower than time.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-5 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-apple-blue rounded-full"></span>
                <p class="text-sm text-apple-dark"><strong>Pace of aging:</strong> are you gaining or losing ground?</p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-apple-blue rounded-full"></span>
                <p class="text-sm text-apple-dark"><strong>Top opportunities:</strong> which 2–3 metrics to focus on</p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-apple-blue rounded-full"></span>
                <p class="text-sm text-apple-dark"><strong>90-day trend:</strong> long-term trajectory, not daily noise</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Vitality Age Orb - Cinematic plasma style -->
          <div class="mt-10 md:mt-0 flex justify-center">
            <div class="vitality-orb-stage">
              <canvas id="vitality-orb" class="vitality-orb-canvas" width="700" height="700" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
              <div class="vitality-orb-label pointer-events-none">
                <span class="vitality-orb-age">27</span>
                <span class="vitality-orb-title">vitality age</span>
                <span class="vitality-orb-delta">3 years younger</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ HOW IT WORKS ════════ -->
    <section id="how-it-works" data-section="how-it-works" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          How it works.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Connect your device. Laso handles the rest.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 md:gap-6">
          <div class="section-reveal text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-apple-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-semibold mx-auto">1</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Connect</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Grant Apple Health access. Works with 52 devices: Apple Watch, Oura, Garmin, Whoop, and more.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal text-center" style="transition-delay:100ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-apple-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-semibold mx-auto">2</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Calibrate</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Personal baselines build from day 1. HRV, resting HR, sleep patterns, strain capacity, all calibrated to your body.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal text-center" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-apple-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-semibold mx-auto">3</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Train</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Check your daily brief. Recovery, strain target, sleep debt, stress level, risk signals, plus one clear action.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal text-center" style="transition-delay:300ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-apple-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-semibold mx-auto">4</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Improve</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Weekly reviews, trend detection, Vitality Age tracking, and annual reports show your progress over months and years.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ WHY LASO ════════ -->
    <section id="why-laso" data-section="why-laso" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          Why Laso.
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 21 3 16.5m0 0L7.5 12M3 16.5h13.5m0-13.5L21 7.5m0 0L16.5 12M21 7.5H7.5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">86 metrics, connected</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Sleep changes HRV. HRV changes recovery. Recovery changes strain capacity. Laso cross-analyzes everything using Granger causality, not just correlations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:100ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Illness prediction</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Multi-metric pattern detection catches illness signals up to 2–3 days before symptoms. Plus 6 predictive alerts: fatigue, burnout, overtraining, insomnia, immune dip, inactivity.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0ZM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 14.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0 1 12 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Your baselines, not averages</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              On-device ML builds your personal normal from day 1. Sleep targets, strain ranges, stress thresholds, all calibrated to you. Gets smarter with every week of data.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ FEATURES ════════ -->
    <section id="features" data-section="features" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          What you can do with Laso.
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <!-- Train Smarter -->
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f97316" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0 1 12 21 8.25 8.25 0 0 1 6.038 7.047 8.287 8.287 0 0 0 9 9.601a8.983 8.983 0 0 1 3.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 0 0 3 2.48Z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Train smarter</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-orange-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Strain score (0–21) with heart rate zone weighting</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-orange-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Daily strain target adjusted to your recovery state</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-orange-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>What-if simulation: "If I run 10K today, what happens to recovery?"</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-orange-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Workout effectiveness scoring: VO2 response, calorie efficiency</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-orange-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Overtraining detection with projected recovery days</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Sleep Better -->
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-7" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.72 9.72 0 0 1 18 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 0 0 3 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 0 0 9.002-5.998Z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Sleep better</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Personalized sleep need (not generic 8 hours)</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Sleep debt tracking with payoff timeline</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Recommended bedtime and wake time</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Sleep stage breakdown: REM, deep, core, awake</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Sleep-to-performance correlation analysis</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Manage Stress -->
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-7" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-yellow-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#eab308" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904 9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09 3.09Z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Manage stress</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>HRV-derived stress score with personal baseline</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Guided breathwork: Cyclic Sighing (Stanford) + Box Breathing</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Stress trend tracking (daily, weekly)</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Key stress drivers: which signals are elevated</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Catch Problems Early -->
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-7" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Catch problems early</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-red-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Illness prediction: multi-metric pattern detection, 2–3 days ahead</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-red-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>6 predictive signals: fatigue, burnout, overtraining, insomnia, immune dip, inactivity</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-red-400 rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Baseline drift detection: gradual shifts over 30+ days</li>
